# teaching_material — rules moved to Config/.cursor/

Agent conventions are split into **rules** and **skills**:

- `Config/.cursor/rules/*.mdc` — always-on and file-scoped guidance
- `Config/.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md` — invoke via `/` or skill matching

Install: see `Config/.cursor/README.md`.

For Cursor to load project rules automatically, symlink or copy:

```bash
mkdir -p .cursor
ln -sfn ../Config/.cursor/rules .cursor/rules
ln -sfn ../Config/.cursor/skills .cursor/skills
```

The retired DeCovarT monolith lives in
`Config/.cursor/archive/.cursorrules.decovart-monolith`.
